        <workflow:ModelOperation name="Create Poem" status="Succeeded">
          <startedAt>2026-09-03T02:58:28</startedAt>
          <baseCommit>4fd07d9e655e9fb782c1ff941ebb027cf145a5ac</baseCommit>
          <output>Stage 1 rewrote the single playground Block org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.NextPoem222 (blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/NextPoem222.bml). The previous Spanish poem was replaced with a new German poem about a tree and a mushroom: the &lt;is> descriptor changed 'written in Spanish' -> 'written in German', the &lt;documentation> body was replaced with four German quatrains, and the &lt;title> property changed from 'El abeto y el hongo' to 'Tanne und Täubling'. Author (John Doe) and year (2026) were left unchanged. No _meta/transform/ ModelTransformation files were touched; the change is correctly scoped to the target Block. Git detected exactly one changed file, matching the diff.</output>
          <completedAt>2026-09-03T02:59:57</completedAt>
          <task>
            <workflow:InstructionTask instructions="Create or update the block org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.NextPoem222.bml that contains a random poem in german about a tree and a mushroom. For each execution create a new poem." />
